mi'e le cnino jbopre.
i mi nitcu le lojbo pendo.

i mi seicni.

i cfipu

________________________________
From: lojban@googlegroups.com <lojban@googlegroups.com> on behalf of Bruno Panasiewicz <ciuak.prog@gmail.com>
Sent: Monday, 8 August 2016 7:00 AM
To: mriste
Subject: [lojban] one poem a week


Hi there.

I'm not going to elaborate on the idea: I propose a weekly magazine (or whatever) of Lojbanists' poems (on some topic).
Once a week, I would announce a topic, to which everyone (who can, and I think everyone can if they want; beginners would also be welcome) would write a poem. It could be short, long - you'd decide.
I think that writing seventeen syllables (if you'd write haiku all the time) a week is a thing that takes one minute, so I encourage everyone to try once I have heard suggestions here.

Please share your thoughts with me,

- mi'e la uakci mu'o

